00:11:25,140 --> 00:11:26,140
Define weird.

277
00:11:26,140 --> 00:11:30,140
She told me to stop flirting and just hook up with Sengoku.

278
00:11:33,140 --> 00:11:38,140
And every time she hears me get a message from you or Miyamura, she asks, is it from a girl?

279
00:11:38,140 --> 00:11:41,140
Uh, sounds like she doesn't realize Sengoku's a guy.

280
00:11:41,140 --> 00:11:43,140
Or she might just be messing with you.

281
00:11:43,140 --> 00:11:45,140
It's possible.

282
00:11:45,140 --> 00:11:48,140
I think Ayasaki is more attractive than Sengoku, though.

283
00:11:48,140 --> 00:11:51,140
Yeah, from what I know about you, he would.

284
00:11:51,140 --> 00:11:56,140
You know, speaking of love interest, her crush was all Motoko could talk about when she came over.

285
00:11:56,140 --> 00:12:02,140
So if she's feeling unpretty, it could just be... misplaced frustration?

286
00:12:02,140 --> 00:12:09,140
It's funny you mention her crush. Because the person Motoko likes appears to like me.

287
00:12:12,140 --> 00:12:15,140
So, Motoko bats for the ladies?

288
00:12:15,140 --> 00:12:17,140
No, that's not it.

289
00:12:17,140 --> 00:12:20,140
Does this diagram explain it? It seems kinda hard to believe.

290
00:12:20,140 --> 00:12:25,140
Yep, that about sums it up. It is hard to believe.

291
00:12:25,140 --> 00:12:27,140
I feel sorry for Motoko.

292
00:12:27,140 --> 00:12:28,140
Not me?

293
00:12:28,140 --> 00:12:30,140
She'll never be able to rest in peace.

294
00:12:30,140 --> 00:12:34,140
Please don't kill off my sister, okay, Hori? And it's not like I stole him!

295
00:12:34,140 --> 00:12:36,140
Sorry, but that qualifies as theft in my book.

296
00:12:36,140 --> 00:12:40,140
I wanted nothing to do with this relationship from the get-go, I swear!

297
00:12:40,140 --> 00:12:43,140
I'm a 24-7 ladies man!

298
00:12:43,140 --> 00:12:47,140
That sentence out of context would get you in a different kind of trouble.

299
00:12:48,140 --> 00:12:51,140
And before we forget, wanna share how you feel about the Prez?

300
00:12:51,140 --> 00:12:57,140
Not sure why this is a misunderstanding, but if you must know, I clearly like Sengoku!

301
00:12:59,140 --> 00:13:00,140
Uh, hey Prez!

302
00:13:00,140 --> 00:13:03,140
So Yorta likes both ladies and Sengoku?

303
00:13:03,140 --> 00:13:07,140
Oh wow, this is getting so complex. Just drama, drama, drama!

304
00:13:07,140 --> 00:13:11,140
It is not! You're the only ones making it complex!

305
00:13:12,140 --> 00:13:13,140
My apologies.

306
00:13:13,140 --> 00:13:14,140
Stop, Sengoku.

307
00:13:15,140 --> 00:13:16,140
You wound me.

308
00:13:17,140 --> 00:13:19,140
Get a girlfriend and all misunderstandings go away.

309
00:13:20,140 --> 00:13:22,140
Sure. I'll go and get one from the store.

310
00:13:23,140 --> 00:13:26,140
