315
00:13:37,140 --> 00:13:39,140
Um, I'm lost.

316
00:13:39,140 --> 00:13:40,140
Same.

317
00:13:44,140 --> 00:13:45,140
You feeling sick?

318
00:13:45,140 --> 00:13:47,140
Or just feel like skipping school?

319
00:13:47,140 --> 00:13:48,140
Oh!

320
00:13:50,140 --> 00:13:51,140
Oh!

321
00:13:54,140 --> 00:13:57,140
For the record, I came in and tried to wake you up once before.

322
00:13:58,140 --> 00:13:59,140
Did you really?

323
00:14:00,140 --> 00:14:01,140
Was I simply dead to the world?

324
00:14:02,140 --> 00:14:04,140
You said I know and pulled the covers right back over your head.

325
00:14:05,140 --> 00:14:06,140
That means I didn't get the memo!

326
00:14:07,140 --> 00:14:08,140
Um, you gonna eat some breakfast?

327
00:14:09,140 --> 00:14:10,140
And wind up later than I already am?

328
00:14:11,140 --> 00:14:14,140
You need to eat at least a slice of toast. Mom's orders.

329
00:14:15,140 --> 00:14:16,140
I'll dine and dance.

330
00:14:17,140 --> 00:14:18,140
You should be making your way to school, too.

331
00:14:19,140 --> 00:14:20,140
I will.

332
00:14:21,140 --> 00:14:22,140
And have a good day!

333
00:14:24,140 --> 00:14:28,140
It's my first time seeing someone actually run to school with toast in their mouth.

334
00:14:28,140 --> 00:14:36,140
Sprinting, while eating bread, dries out your mouth like crazy!

335
00:14:37,140 --> 00:14:39,140
I can't eat and run at the same time!

336
00:14:42,140 --> 00:14:43,140
Walking it is.

337
00:14:44,140 --> 00:14:48,140
I'm late! I'm late!

338
00:14:49,140 --> 00:14:58,140
I just experienced the bump into a boy with toast in your mouth trope, so there's a decent chance he's a super hot transfer student!

339
00:14:59,140 --> 00:15:03,140
Hey, Yoshikawa? You know that I can hear you, right? I being Yuta?

340
00:15:04,140 --> 00:15:10,140
Fancy running into you here. Good morning.

341
00:15:10,140 --> 00:15:11,140
Is it, though?

342
00:15:12,140 --> 00:15:14,140
I take it you'll reflect, too?

343
00:15:14,140 --> 00:15:16,140
Uh-huh. I should've gotten a bit way earlier.

344
00:15:17,140 --> 00:15:19,140
That we'd make it even if we ran, so let's just walk.

345
00:15:20,140 --> 00:15:22,140
I'm late! I'm late!

346
00:15:23,140 --> 00:15:26,140
What? Are you guys on a stroll? You're both as late as I am!

347
00:15:27,140 --> 00:15:29,140
It says you with your Onigiri.

348
00:15:30,140 --> 00:15:33,140
I woefully realize we'll be late no matter what.

349
00:15:34,140 --> 00:15:35,140
No, I'm woeful, too.

350
00:15:35,140 --> 00:15:36,140
Flavor?

351
00:15:36,140 --> 00:15:37,140
It only has salt.

352
00:15:37,140 --> 00:15:38,140
Sad?

353
00:15:38,140 --> 00:15:39,140
I'm late! I'm late!

354
00:15:40,140 --> 00:15:43,140
What are the three of you doing? We all need to hurry!

355
00:15:44,140 --> 00:15:45,140
Then why do you stop at the store?

356
00:15:46,140 --> 00:15:47,140
Flavor?

357
00:15:47,140 --> 00:15:48,140
It's a meat bun.

358
00:15:48,140 --> 00:15:51,140
All of you yelled about being late as if shouting it would up your speed.

359
00:15:52,140 --> 00:15:53,140
True.

360
00:15:53,140 --> 00:15:54,140
Is there morning assembly today?

361
00:15:55,140 --> 00:15:56,140
Nope.

362
00:15:56,140 --> 00:15:57,140
Let's take our time, then.

363
00:16:01,140 --> 00:16:02,140
Huh?

364
00:16:02,140 --> 00:16:07,140
