371
00:16:19,140 --> 00:16:20,140
Huh?

372
00:16:20,140 --> 00:16:23,140
Oh, I think I remember hearing that in homeroom yesterday. Oops.

373
00:16:23,140 --> 00:16:26,140
I would have slathered my toast and jam if I had known!

374
00:16:26,140 --> 00:16:28,140
What wavelength are the four of you on?

375
00:16:29,140 --> 00:16:32,140
I don't know, man. I just wish I could have put something in my rice ball!

376
00:16:32,140 --> 00:16:34,140
