383
00:16:54,140 --> 00:16:56,140
Ah! Those kids I saw were middle schoolers then!

384
00:16:56,140 --> 00:16:57,140
Yep, they were.

385
00:16:58,140 --> 00:17:00,140
Where's Yuki? And Miyamura?

386
00:17:00,140 --> 00:17:02,140
