388
00:17:05,140 --> 00:17:06,140
Oh, it's silly.

389
00:17:07,140 --> 00:17:08,140
Kyan Kyan!

390
00:17:08,140 --> 00:17:09,140
Hey!

391
00:17:10,140 --> 00:17:11,140
