404
00:17:47,140 --> 00:17:51,140
So, while I'm not positive, I'm pretty sure that we're somewhere around here.

405
00:17:52,140 --> 00:17:53,140
Hey, Tom!

406
00:17:54,140 --> 00:17:55,140
What's up, Ju?

407
00:17:56,140 --> 00:17:57,140
Go!

408
00:17:57,140 --> 00:17:58,140
Disappear, body!

409
00:17:59,140 --> 00:18:00,140
Are you in pain or something?

410
