Um, excuse me.

411
00:18:01,140 --> 00:18:03,140
We got a little lost.

412
00:18:03,140 --> 00:18:06,140
You know the place you're trying to go?

413
00:18:07,140 --> 00:18:08,140
The edge of this field.

414
00:18:08,140 --> 00:18:10,140
We're supposed to meet up with the rest of our class there.

415
00:18:11,140 --> 00:18:14,140
Oh, you'll get there quicker through the exit on the side of the building.

416
00:18:14,140 --> 00:18:17,140
Follow this hallway until you reach the staircase on the right.

417
00:18:17,140 --> 00:18:19,140
The doors at the bottom lead outside.

418
00:18:20,140 --> 00:18:21,140
Great.

419
00:18:21,140 --> 00:18:22,140
Thanks so much.

420
00:18:23,140 --> 00:18:24,140
Shu, get over here!

421
00:18:24,140 --> 00:18:25,140
I got my name!

422
00:18:25,140 --> 00:18:26,140
I don't understand!

423
00:18:26,140 --> 00:18:27,140
Man, what's with him?

424
00:18:27,140 --> 00:18:28,140
Well, um, we should get going.

425
00:18:28,140 --> 00:18:29,140
Right.

426
00:18:29,140 --> 00:18:30,140
Take care and whatnot.

427
00:18:31,140 --> 00:18:32,140
Yes, please leave.

428
00:18:32,140 --> 00:18:33,140
Do I wanna know?

429
00:18:33,140 --> 00:18:34,140
Stop goofing off and let's get to the cafeteria, okay?

430
00:18:34,140 --> 00:18:35,140
We gotta beat the lunch crowd while we still have a chance, Iyura!

431
00:18:35,140 --> 00:18:36,140
Ayasaki, no!

432
00:18:36,140 --> 00:18:37,140
Iyura!

433
00:18:37,140 --> 00:18:38,140
Come on!

434
00:18:38,140 --> 00:18:39,140
Did you see something?

435
00:18:39,140 --> 00:18:40,140
What happened?

436
00:18:41,140 --> 00:18:42,140
components, the one time a girl calls my name!

437
00:18:42,140 --> 00:18:47,140
Hyuura!

438
00:18:47,140 --> 00:18:48,140
Oh, itero!

439
00:18:48,140 --> 00:18:49,140
Hello?

440
00:18:49,140 --> 00:19:01,140
Use me to해요!

441
00:19:01,140 --> 00:19:02,140
Kitahara's still close!

442
00:19:02,140 --> 00:19:03,140
ポлат me for sure!

443
00:19:03,140 --> 00:19:04,140
Sorry ladies!

444
00:19:04,140 --> 00:19:05,140
Go on without me!

445
00:19:05,140 --> 00:19:07,140
Stop holding up that wall and move.

446
00:19:07,140 --> 00:19:08,140
Oh.

447
00:19:08,140 --> 00:19:09,140
Right.

448
00:19:09,140 --> 00:19:10,940
Right. I'm sorry.

449
00:19:11,940 --> 00:19:12,940
Wait.

450
00:19:16,340 --> 00:19:18,340
Is that you?

451
00:19:18,340 --> 00:19:19,940
Senpai?

452
00:19:19,940 --> 00:19:21,740
I'm Senpai now?

453
00:19:21,740 --> 00:19:22,940
If he'd called me anything else,

454
00:19:22,940 --> 00:19:25,740
I could have played it off like he had the wrong guy!

455
00:19:27,140 --> 00:19:28,740
Senpai, um...

456
00:19:29,540 --> 00:19:32,740
Oh, it's hard to pretend I'm a total stranger when he calls me that!

457
00:19:32,740 --> 00:19:34,740
