460
00:19:46,140 --> 00:19:48,140
Don't bully the middle schoolers!

461
00:19:48,140 --> 00:19:51,140
Look, the poor kid's shaking from head to toe.

462
00:19:51,140 --> 00:19:55,140
I think they're more afraid of you and your lethal surprise attacks, Yasuda.

463
00:19:57,140 --> 00:19:59,140
So how do you know Iorta?

464
00:19:59,140 --> 00:20:02,140
Do you go to the same middle school that he did?

465
00:20:02,140 --> 00:20:06,140
Sorry, but do either of you know if my Senpai has a girlfriend?

466
00:20:09,140 --> 00:20:12,140
I get stifled giggles and sympathy?

467
00:20:12,140 --> 00:20:13,140
What do we do?

468
00:20:13,140 --> 00:20:15,140
Should we just lie and say that he does?

469
00:20:15,140 --> 00:20:18,140
I'm thinking we dodged the question altogether.

470
00:20:18,140 --> 00:20:20,140
Now I feel even worse!

471
00:20:20,140 --> 00:20:22,140
