I don't want to leave you alone

528
00:22:48,440 --> 00:22:52,540
Ah, what are you doing today?

529
00:22:52,540 --> 00:22:55,140
That's the day that I'm like

530
00:22:55,140 --> 00:23:00,140
I'm looking forward to it

531
00:23:00,140 --> 00:23:04,140
I'm saying that you need to be in front of me

532
00:23:04,140 --> 00:23:09,140
Ah, I'm looking forward to it

533
00:23:09,140 --> 00:23:15,140
また想いが張り裂けそうなのに

534
00:23:15,140 --> 00:23:23,140
URLより短い言葉にしかできない私です

535
00:23:23,140 --> 00:23:25,140
I'm so sad

